    <string name="home_1_bagna_gli_elettrodi" formatted="true">1. Wet the electrodes and put on the strap: it turns on by itself.\n2. When it appears below, tap Connect.\n%1$s sets everything up by itself: heartbeat and RR intervals, and with the Polar H10 also movement and breathing. Heart rate straps from other brands work too (Garmin, Wahoo, Coospo…): with these there is no accelerometer, and RR intervals are checked in the first minutes of recording.</string>
